WEBVTT

01:42.840 --> 01:43.800
You've moved on.

01:44.600 --> 01:45.360
But I haven't.

01:46.160 --> 01:46.759
Cao Ping.

01:48.280 --> 01:49.039
Look ahead.

01:49.759 --> 01:51.400
Stop clinging to the past.

01:54.320 --> 01:55.520
From the day I went to prison,

01:56.440 --> 01:57.759
I did try to look ahead.

01:59.520 --> 02:00.040
For the past two years,

02:00.040 --> 02:01.600
every day, I worked to turn myself around.

02:02.120 --> 02:03.240
So I could get out sooner

02:03.240 --> 02:04.160
and reunite with my sister.

02:06.040 --> 02:07.120
What exactly do you want?

02:14.760 --> 02:15.760
I don't want anything.

02:16.800 --> 02:17.840
I just want to tell you,

02:18.520 --> 02:19.360
don't touch my sister.

02:20.360 --> 02:21.200
Or I won't let

02:21.200 --> 02:22.520
the people around you live in peace.

02:29.040 --> 02:30.120
I never touched your sister.

02:31.360 --> 02:32.280
Our grudge

02:33.160 --> 02:33.920
is between us.

02:34.360 --> 02:35.600
Come at me if you've got guts.

02:38.600 --> 02:39.600
Stop fighting.

02:40.360 --> 02:41.480
Keep this up and I'll call the police.

02:42.280 --> 02:42.960
Xing Wu.

02:47.360 --> 02:48.000
Xing Wu.

02:48.840 --> 02:49.680
We're not done.

02:57.000 --> 02:57.880
Who is he?

03:00.440 --> 03:01.200
Someone I know.

03:02.600 --> 03:04.120
Why did you two fight?

03:06.000 --> 03:06.560
It's nothing.

03:06.760 --> 03:07.680
You almost fought.

03:07.680 --> 03:08.720
How is that nothing?

03:10.120 --> 03:11.400
Before you came to Zhazhating,

03:12.800 --> 03:13.840
I got into fights

03:14.560 --> 03:15.520
more times than I can count.

03:16.600 --> 03:17.280
Xing Wu.

03:18.120 --> 03:18.920
Xing Wu.

03:20.040 --> 03:21.360
If anything happens,

03:21.520 --> 03:22.640
you have to tell me.

03:57.200 --> 03:58.280
Our grudge

03:59.000 --> 03:59.720
is between us.

04:00.360 --> 04:01.440
Come at me if you've got guts.

04:02.320 --> 04:03.520
Don't touch my family.

04:04.960 --> 04:05.920
That'd be too easy on you.

04:07.080 --> 04:07.760
Xing Wu.

04:08.560 --> 04:09.640
As long as I'm alive,

04:10.440 --> 04:11.960
I won't let you have it easy.

04:12.680 --> 04:13.520
I'll drag your life

04:13.520 --> 04:14.400
down into the same

04:14.920 --> 04:16.320
gutter as mine.

04:23.720 --> 04:24.280
Thanks.

04:24.280 --> 04:25.000
I'll do it, Auntie.

04:25.400 --> 04:25.840
Okay.

04:26.240 --> 04:27.320
I transferred the money to you.

04:30.200 --> 04:31.440
Let's go buy some meat.

04:32.200 --> 04:33.159
What else do you want?

04:33.680 --> 04:34.320
Anything is fine.

04:34.440 --> 04:35.600
Li, come here.

04:35.640 --> 04:36.320
Fresh tenderloin.

04:36.440 --> 04:36.880
Want a piece?

04:36.880 --> 04:37.760
Fresh like fresh?

04:38.920 --> 04:39.840
I'll take this one.

04:39.840 --> 04:40.280
Sure.

04:40.400 --> 04:41.520
And two pig's trotters.

04:41.560 --> 04:42.680
Sure, no problem.

04:43.240 --> 04:43.720
Here you go.

04:43.920 --> 04:44.760
Okay. I got it.

04:44.840 --> 04:45.520
Come again.

04:47.560 --> 04:48.600
Grandma said

04:48.720 --> 04:49.920
you and Wu have been studying

04:50.000 --> 04:50.640
so hard lately,

04:50.760 --> 04:52.440
so you need good nutrition.

04:53.320 --> 04:53.960
Ye.

04:54.240 --> 04:55.440
Why are you so distracted?

04:58.120 --> 04:58.920
It's nothing.

05:00.880 --> 05:01.840
Is it Xing Wu?

05:04.080 --> 05:05.240
I just feel like

05:06.320 --> 05:07.960
he's always carrying something inside.

05:10.160 --> 05:11.400
Did you two have a fight?

05:12.280 --> 05:13.000
No.

05:14.480 --> 05:16.280
I just don't quite understand him.

05:17.840 --> 05:18.520
Auntie.

05:18.880 --> 05:20.080
He's like a clam.

05:20.600 --> 05:21.560
You know something's

05:21.560 --> 05:22.520
locked up inside,

05:23.040 --> 05:24.280
but you can't get him to open up.

05:25.960 --> 05:27.080
Do you ever feel that way?

05:27.640 --> 05:28.320
Yes.

05:28.600 --> 05:29.640
Of course I do.

05:30.120 --> 05:31.320
When Wu was little,

05:31.440 --> 05:32.840
I did have the energy to look after him.

05:33.240 --> 05:34.760
I always wanted to know

05:34.760 --> 05:36.000
what was really on his mind,

05:36.200 --> 05:36.840
afraid that something

05:36.840 --> 05:37.960
was upsetting him

05:37.960 --> 05:39.040
and he'd keep it all bottled up.

05:39.400 --> 05:40.520
When I was young,

05:40.520 --> 05:41.920
I wanted to be a good mother too.

05:42.920 --> 05:43.800
And then?

05:44.680 --> 05:46.240
Then I couldn't even

05:46.240 --> 05:47.280
take care of myself.

05:47.400 --> 05:49.400
Every day I had debts to pay,

05:49.440 --> 05:51.280
food to put on the table.

05:51.400 --> 05:52.680
How could I watch him?

05:53.680 --> 05:54.360
But Wu

05:54.360 --> 05:55.360
was a pretty sensible kid.

05:55.800 --> 05:56.880
They say the child who cries

05:56.920 --> 05:57.800
gets the milk.

05:58.080 --> 05:59.640
But he never cried.

06:00.440 --> 06:01.800
He never asked me for anything either.

06:02.280 --> 06:04.400
After a while, I just treated it

06:04.520 --> 06:05.560
as if nothing had happened,

06:06.120 --> 06:07.400
as if everything was fine.

06:08.040 --> 06:08.960
I got used to it.

06:09.120 --> 06:09.760
I stopped worrying.

06:11.680 --> 06:12.160
Let's go.

06:12.280 --> 06:13.680
Let's buy some yam too.

06:14.560 --> 06:15.840
Pig's trotters stewed with yam.

06:16.000 --> 06:16.920
Wu's favorite.

06:27.880 --> 06:29.200
Your grades lately

06:29.600 --> 06:31.040
are like a roller coaster.

06:31.720 --> 06:33.520
You dropped nearly a hundred points.

06:34.280 --> 06:35.200
On the next exam,

06:35.560 --> 06:36.720
you'd better work harder.

06:38.240 --> 06:39.520
Don't worry. I know.

06:40.360 --> 06:40.920
Cousin.

06:41.159 --> 06:41.680
Bro Wu.

06:44.040 --> 06:45.560
Weren't you riding bikes?

06:45.640 --> 06:46.880
Why are you on the bus too?

06:47.159 --> 06:47.960
The wheel broke.

06:50.760 --> 06:52.280
It's been windy lately.

06:52.440 --> 06:53.200
Too lazy to ride.

06:54.560 --> 06:56.920
And I can squeeze in some vocab.

06:58.040 --> 06:58.600
Not bad.

06:58.880 --> 07:00.160
You finally know how to study.

07:00.840 --> 07:01.520
Xing Wu.

07:01.680 --> 07:02.560
You're losing.

07:03.240 --> 07:03.760
I won't.

07:05.120 --> 07:05.640
I won't.

07:09.440 --> 07:10.000
What's this?

07:10.760 --> 07:11.680
Testing whether phone location

07:11.680 --> 07:12.560
still works.

07:14.000 --> 07:15.120
Why not just call?

07:15.440 --> 07:16.640
What if it's urgent?

07:17.160 --> 07:18.200
Three quick taps. Way easier.

07:25.840 --> 07:26.200
Let's go.

07:34.120 --> 07:35.280
Wenhui, did you hear?

07:36.360 --> 07:37.320
Cao Fan's brother

07:37.640 --> 07:39.440
served two years for stabbing someone.

07:40.040 --> 07:40.880
Really?

07:40.960 --> 07:42.000
Don't believe rumors.

07:42.000 --> 07:43.080
Of course it's fake.

07:43.400 --> 07:44.520
Cao Fan's family

07:44.520 --> 07:45.400
is pretty well-off, isn't it?

07:45.440 --> 07:46.640
She always ranks top three too.

07:47.159 --> 07:48.040
Use your brain.

07:48.520 --> 07:49.480
If there were nothing to it,

07:49.480 --> 07:50.520
would everyone be talking?

07:52.040 --> 07:52.880
Then it must be true.

07:53.480 --> 07:54.960
They say it with so much detail.

07:55.280 --> 07:57.120
They even say it has to do with Xing Wu.

07:57.320 --> 07:57.960
What do you mean?

07:58.600 --> 07:59.800
I saw Cao Fan this weekend.

08:00.520 --> 08:01.080
She was at some

08:01.080 --> 08:03.280
rundown laundry shop cleaning shoes.

08:04.080 --> 08:04.960
I went up and asked her.

08:04.960 --> 08:06.160
She looked so guilty.

08:06.520 --> 08:07.280
She even said her brother

08:07.280 --> 08:08.520
was a boss in Shenzhen.

08:08.840 --> 08:09.400
To me,

08:09.560 --> 08:10.800
her brother is just an ex-con.

08:11.360 --> 08:12.560
No wonder her clothes

08:12.560 --> 08:14.040
smell like a laundry shop.

08:14.400 --> 08:15.000
And she said

08:15.520 --> 08:16.040
her clothes

08:16.040 --> 08:17.200
were sent to a laundry shop

08:17.200 --> 08:18.160
to be cleaned.

08:18.920 --> 08:20.720
Who's she playing, some rich princess?

08:25.680 --> 08:26.960
If she weren't good at school

08:26.960 --> 08:28.000
and we couldn't copy her homework,

08:28.080 --> 08:29.320
who'd want to hang out with her?

08:32.200 --> 08:33.080
Having a little gossip party?

08:34.280 --> 08:35.320
Why are you everywhere?

08:36.120 --> 08:37.559
You heard everything we said?

08:37.799 --> 08:38.640
From which part?

08:38.919 --> 08:40.520
From Cao Fan's brother,

08:41.240 --> 08:41.960
or Cao Fan?

08:43.280 --> 08:44.440
You were talking so loudly.

08:44.680 --> 08:45.400
Why not use a megaphone

08:45.400 --> 08:46.760
so the whole school can hear?

08:47.400 --> 08:48.720
So what if you heard?

08:48.840 --> 08:49.640
About your dad,

08:49.640 --> 08:50.680
she was the one who spread it.

08:51.000 --> 08:52.360
I'm kind of getting back at her for you.

08:52.800 --> 08:53.560
No need.

08:54.520 --> 08:55.600
Back then, those rumors

08:55.960 --> 08:57.080
you helped spread too.

08:57.600 --> 08:58.160
Don't make it sound like

08:58.160 --> 08:59.360
you defended me.

09:03.240 --> 09:04.720
Let me give you both a friendly warning.

09:05.040 --> 09:06.440
You may be close now,

09:07.240 --> 09:08.520
but who knows what happens later?

09:18.200 --> 09:19.360
You heard all that, right?

09:20.400 --> 09:21.720
Now I'm everyone's target.

09:21.800 --> 09:22.720
You must be thrilled.

09:23.080 --> 09:23.960
I'm not thrilled.

09:24.440 --> 09:25.200
I never think

09:25.200 --> 09:26.520
attacking someone over family matters

09:26.520 --> 09:27.320
is anything to be proud of.

09:28.120 --> 09:29.520
Every family has ups and downs.

09:30.040 --> 09:30.720
We're students.

09:30.720 --> 09:32.040
We should just focus on studying.

09:33.600 --> 09:34.160
No one wants

09:34.160 --> 09:35.360
to be pushed into the spotlight,

09:35.760 --> 09:36.320
right?

09:37.640 --> 09:38.760
Mind your own business.

09:38.960 --> 09:40.200
No one asked you to stand up for me.

09:40.960 --> 09:42.280
I'm standing up

09:42.280 --> 09:43.120
for what's right.

09:43.360 --> 09:44.720
Not for you.

09:48.640 --> 09:49.640
Your nose is bleeding.

09:51.200 --> 09:52.240
Here. Tissue.

09:52.720 --> 09:54.280
Don't pretend to care about me.

09:54.280 --> 09:55.080
We're not close.

09:59.200 --> 09:59.680
And

10:00.320 --> 10:01.360
you'd better not tell anyone

10:01.360 --> 10:02.520
about Xing Wu and my brother.

10:02.920 --> 10:03.800
Their grudge

10:03.800 --> 10:04.920
has nothing to do with me.

10:05.520 --> 10:06.520
I owe you one this time.

10:07.920 --> 10:08.520
Grudge?

10:13.960 --> 10:15.720
There was a boy in the same game.

10:15.720 --> 10:16.600
He didn't like him,

10:17.520 --> 10:18.960
so they had a conflict.

10:19.160 --> 10:21.720
He slashed his back with a knife.

10:22.120 --> 10:23.120
Cao Fan's brother

10:23.640 --> 10:25.600
served two years for stabbing someone.

10:25.680 --> 10:26.720
If there were nothing to it,

10:26.720 --> 10:27.600
would everyone be talking?

10:28.200 --> 10:29.080
Then it must be true.

10:29.640 --> 10:31.520
They even say it has to do with Xing Wu.

10:35.720 --> 10:37.200
One camera at the entrance

10:37.320 --> 10:37.920
should be enough.

10:38.720 --> 10:40.000
No need inside, right?

10:40.520 --> 10:41.880
The brand you bought

10:42.280 --> 10:42.760
isn't cheap either.

10:42.800 --> 10:43.320
Nail.

10:43.920 --> 10:44.440
It's expensive.

10:45.080 --> 10:46.320
Better safe than sorry.

10:46.440 --> 10:48.000
Yang Gang has Cao Ping backing him now.

10:48.400 --> 10:49.240
Those guys

10:49.400 --> 10:50.000
will probably come

10:50.000 --> 10:50.880
to cause trouble from time to time.

10:51.360 --> 10:52.600
Last time, so many of them came,

10:52.960 --> 10:54.160
and nothing serious happened, right?

10:54.640 --> 10:55.840
Don't be too nervous.

10:56.560 --> 10:57.320
What if one day

10:57.320 --> 10:58.040
I can't get here in time?

10:58.600 --> 10:59.400
If things get out of hand,

10:59.600 --> 11:01.120
another camera means more protection.

11:01.360 --> 11:02.520
It can be evidence if we call the police.

11:03.960 --> 11:04.880
I'm fine.

11:05.360 --> 11:07.160
Cao Ping must be after you.

11:07.520 --> 11:08.320
If you need help,

11:08.520 --> 11:09.400
you must tell us.

11:09.840 --> 11:10.640
Dahei and I

11:10.800 --> 11:11.920
are ready to charge in with you anytime.

11:17.080 --> 11:18.520
Charge in? Charge into what?

11:18.920 --> 11:20.000
Watched too many gangster movies?

11:20.680 --> 11:22.200
If your sister knew I took you fighting,

11:22.600 --> 11:23.840
she'll destroy us both.

11:24.760 --> 11:25.840
True.

11:27.280 --> 11:28.120
Sometimes,

11:28.400 --> 11:29.840
fists don't solve problems.

11:32.080 --> 11:33.200
If Cao Ping

11:34.280 --> 11:35.200
keeps coming after you,

11:35.600 --> 11:36.600
what are you going to do?

11:39.880 --> 11:41.160
Stop worrying.

11:46.040 --> 11:46.600
Dahei.

11:47.800 --> 11:48.240
Bro Wu.

11:48.520 --> 11:49.000
What is it?

11:49.760 --> 11:51.320
I need to prepare for the exam lately.

11:51.600 --> 11:52.200
I probably

11:52.520 --> 11:53.800
won't have much time to come to Shunyi.

11:54.320 --> 11:55.600
I don't feel easy leaving Quanya alone.

11:55.920 --> 11:56.840
If you're free,

11:57.200 --> 11:58.080
help me keep an eye on things.

11:58.600 --> 11:59.720
Bro Wu, I know even if you don't say it.

11:59.720 --> 12:00.440
Don't worry.

12:00.720 --> 12:01.640
When the guys and I are free,

12:01.640 --> 12:02.320
we'll go check on the place.

12:02.680 --> 12:03.760
You just focus on studying

12:03.800 --> 12:04.640
and prepare for the exam.

12:05.520 --> 12:05.960
Thanks.

12:06.680 --> 12:08.200
We're brothers. No need to thank me.

12:08.360 --> 12:09.840
We're all so jealous of you now.

12:10.120 --> 12:11.400
Look at you in that school uniform.

12:12.200 --> 12:13.120
You look proud.

12:13.560 --> 12:14.680
People like us may spend

12:14.680 --> 12:15.560
our whole lives

12:15.560 --> 12:16.240
stuck in this little shop.

12:16.320 --> 12:17.520
But you're different, Bro Wu.

12:17.640 --> 12:18.280
You're smart.

12:18.720 --> 12:19.680
You have a mind for studying.

12:20.080 --> 12:21.080
You finally went back to school.

12:21.240 --> 12:22.160
You need to seize the chance.

12:22.400 --> 12:23.080
Don't let the dirty mess

12:23.080 --> 12:23.920
from the past

12:24.080 --> 12:24.720
drag you down again.

12:27.000 --> 12:27.520
Don't worry.

12:27.920 --> 12:28.520
I know.

12:29.240 --> 12:30.000
Good luck, Bro Wu.

12:32.880 --> 12:33.400
I'm off.

12:38.080 --> 12:39.000
Here, eat.

12:51.800 --> 12:52.320
Why did you suddenly

12:52.320 --> 12:53.360
treat us to skewers?

12:53.560 --> 12:54.440
I want to ask you something.

12:57.320 --> 12:58.000
What is it?

12:59.920 --> 13:00.680
At school,

13:01.200 --> 13:02.320
people have been saying

13:03.120 --> 13:03.720
that

13:03.840 --> 13:06.760
Cao Fan's brother did two years in prison

13:07.080 --> 13:07.760
and just got out.

13:08.640 --> 13:09.720
Have you heard that?

13:14.840 --> 13:15.920
Xing Wu's enemy

13:16.520 --> 13:17.680
is Cao Fan's brother, right?

13:19.000 --> 13:19.720
I don't know.

13:20.920 --> 13:21.800
There are rumors

13:21.800 --> 13:22.680
even I don't know?

13:22.800 --> 13:24.120
Then it must be a rumor.

13:24.720 --> 13:25.120
Right.

13:26.520 --> 13:27.720
The scar on Xing Wu's back

13:28.200 --> 13:29.600
was from him two years ago.

13:30.400 --> 13:31.760
That's why he served two years.

13:33.400 --> 13:34.520
He only got out recently.

13:35.280 --> 13:35.760
Right?

13:40.440 --> 13:41.120
Undercooked.

13:41.400 --> 13:42.760
Xing Wu was afraid he'd go after me,

13:43.240 --> 13:43.760
and so he asked

13:43.760 --> 13:44.760
you two to follow me.

13:45.640 --> 13:46.520
Am I wrong?

13:47.040 --> 13:47.800
The skewers need sauce.

13:47.800 --> 13:49.040
I'll go get some.

13:49.160 --> 13:50.840
Feels like not enough skewers.

13:50.840 --> 13:51.560
I'll grab more.

13:55.400 --> 13:57.320
You two are terrible actors.

13:59.240 --> 14:00.280
Your faces tell me

14:00.280 --> 14:01.000
I guessed right.

14:06.360 --> 14:07.240
Sorry.

14:07.520 --> 14:08.760
The number you dialed

14:08.760 --> 14:10.040
is temporarily unavailable.

14:20.000 --> 14:20.720
Sorry.

14:21.160 --> 14:22.240
The number you dialed

14:26.120 --> 14:26.800
Sorry.

14:27.200 --> 14:28.400
The number you dialed

14:40.560 --> 14:41.240
Qing Ye figured out

14:41.240 --> 14:41.960
your connection with Cao Ping.

14:41.960 --> 14:42.520
Qing Ye?

14:42.720 --> 14:43.800
She wouldn't let us follow her.

14:44.200 --> 14:45.240
I'm afraid she may go find him.

14:45.280 --> 14:45.880
Qing Ye.

14:50.080 --> 14:50.840
Qing Ye.

15:53.240 --> 15:53.680
You...

15:54.360 --> 15:55.840
Why are you panting?

15:56.560 --> 15:57.240
I'm sorry.

15:58.400 --> 15:59.320
Let me hold you for a while.

16:08.000 --> 16:09.880
My phone died.

16:11.520 --> 16:12.880
Right before it shut off,

16:13.720 --> 16:15.640
I saw you called me.

16:16.320 --> 16:18.120
I quickly sent you my location.

16:19.200 --> 16:20.240
I didn't expect

16:21.720 --> 16:23.320
it would make you think I was in danger.

16:34.520 --> 16:35.520
As long as you're okay.

16:42.280 --> 16:43.120
Actually,

16:43.560 --> 16:45.080
after I sent you my location,

16:45.240 --> 16:46.400
for one moment,

16:47.120 --> 16:47.760
I thought

16:49.440 --> 16:50.520
I might as well trick you,

16:51.600 --> 16:52.560
let you fail to find me,

16:53.960 --> 16:55.320
and let you feel

16:56.160 --> 16:57.600
what it's like to wait with no reply.

17:01.520 --> 17:02.720
But then I thought,

17:04.000 --> 17:04.560
forget it.

17:06.000 --> 17:07.000
No matter what,

17:09.040 --> 17:10.800
you have the right to keep secrets.

17:18.240 --> 17:19.280
Then I'll tell you

17:20.720 --> 17:21.720
what happened two years ago.

17:28.680 --> 17:29.560
Two years ago,

17:30.160 --> 17:31.600
Xuan Island was mortgaged by Xing Guodong.

17:32.520 --> 17:33.680
We were buried in debt.

17:34.080 --> 17:34.960
Grandma was in the hospital

17:35.960 --> 17:36.840
and urgently needed money.

17:38.920 --> 17:39.760
Back then, I decided

17:39.760 --> 17:41.040
to enter the city basketball tournament.

17:42.040 --> 17:43.240
If I won MVP,

17:44.200 --> 17:44.960
there would be prize money.

17:49.680 --> 17:52.840
Xuan Island, Xuan Island, we're the best!

17:53.000 --> 17:54.240
Xuan Island! Xuan Island!

17:54.480 --> 17:55.840
Xing Wu! Xing Wu!

17:56.320 --> 17:57.560
Xing Wu! Xing Wu!

17:58.040 --> 17:59.240
Also in that tournament

17:59.880 --> 18:00.600
was Cao Ping.

18:01.520 --> 18:01.880
At the time,

18:01.880 --> 18:03.040
he was at another vocational school

18:03.280 --> 18:04.160
in his final year.

18:05.600 --> 18:06.440
For him,

18:07.240 --> 18:08.720
winning that tournament

18:09.520 --> 18:10.520
was his last chance

18:10.520 --> 18:11.280
to get into sports school.

18:13.120 --> 18:14.280
But he injured his Achilles tendon.

18:15.080 --> 18:16.520
Xuan Island! Xuan Island!

18:16.560 --> 18:18.040
Jieba! Jieba!

18:18.120 --> 18:19.760
Jieba rules the court!

18:20.160 --> 18:21.400
Jieba! Jieba!

18:21.560 --> 18:22.960
Brother Ping, how's your foot?

18:24.200 --> 18:24.880
I'm fine.

18:25.240 --> 18:26.240
We have to give it everything.

18:26.240 --> 18:26.800
Do you hear me?

18:27.240 --> 18:28.240
With Brother Ping's skills,

18:28.400 --> 18:29.200
even injured,

18:29.400 --> 18:30.040
winning MVP

18:30.040 --> 18:30.720
won't be a problem.

18:30.920 --> 18:31.400
Right?

18:31.840 --> 18:32.920
We need everyone.

18:33.680 --> 18:35.200
Xuan Island! Xuan Island!

18:35.320 --> 18:36.640
Jieba! Jieba!

18:36.960 --> 18:38.400
Xuan Island! Xuan Island!

18:38.600 --> 18:40.240
Jieba! Jieba!

18:40.520 --> 18:41.840
Xuan Island! Xuan Island!

18:42.240 --> 18:43.680
We're the best!

18:43.920 --> 18:45.600
Xuan Island! Xuan Island!

19:02.320 --> 19:03.040
Go!

19:19.560 --> 19:20.080
Nice!

19:20.240 --> 19:21.560
Xuan Island scores again.

19:21.680 --> 19:22.520
That's Xing Wu.

19:22.560 --> 19:24.080
As a newcomer, he is unstoppable,

19:24.160 --> 19:25.080
charging in fiercely.

19:25.240 --> 19:26.720
He truly is a dark horse.

19:26.960 --> 19:27.960
Cao Ping of Team Jieba

19:27.960 --> 19:29.040
has finally met

19:29.040 --> 19:29.920
a strong opponent.

19:30.120 --> 19:30.720
Will today's

19:30.720 --> 19:31.360
MVP title

19:31.520 --> 19:32.600
slip from his hands?

19:38.160 --> 19:40.640
Go! Go! Go!

19:40.680 --> 19:47.520
Go! Go! Go!

20:07.520 --> 20:17.000
Go! Go! Go!

20:19.360 --> 20:20.000
Are you okay?

20:42.680 --> 20:43.960
Xing Wu.

20:44.120 --> 20:45.320
Let's congratulate Xing Wu

20:45.360 --> 20:46.360
on winning

20:46.360 --> 20:48.080
this tournament's MVP title.

20:48.640 --> 20:49.800
Congratulations, Xuan Island.

20:49.880 --> 20:53.520
Xuan Island! Xuan Island!

20:53.600 --> 20:56.280
Xuan Island! Xuan Island!

20:56.360 --> 20:59.040
Xuan Island! Xuan Island!

20:59.080 --> 21:01.720
Xuan Island! Xuan Island!

21:01.840 --> 21:05.320
Xuan Island! Xuan Island!

21:06.600 --> 21:07.360
Congrats, Bro Wu.

21:07.360 --> 21:08.880
You got MVP

21:08.920 --> 21:09.800
and the prize money.

21:09.880 --> 21:11.160
Xuan Island champions!

21:16.120 --> 21:18.040
Order whatever you want tonight.

21:18.200 --> 21:18.880
Bro Wu's paying.

21:19.160 --> 21:20.640
Really?

21:20.760 --> 21:22.280
When has Bro Wu ever lied to you?

21:22.920 --> 21:23.520
Boss.

21:23.880 --> 21:25.120
Twenty lamb kidneys.

21:25.280 --> 21:26.720
And twenty flank skewers.

21:26.960 --> 21:28.040
Sure. Coming right up.

21:28.280 --> 21:29.560
Neither of you leaves tonight

21:29.800 --> 21:30.440
until you finish them.

21:30.520 --> 21:32.120
Boss, twenty meat skewers.

21:32.120 --> 21:32.960
And whatever else you recommend.

21:33.080 --> 21:34.560
Sure. One moment. Coming up.

21:35.680 --> 21:36.200
Bro Wu.

21:36.600 --> 21:37.640
Cao Ping is here.

21:41.400 --> 21:42.520
Look at his loser face.

21:42.520 --> 21:43.440
One look and you know he lost.

21:45.400 --> 21:47.280
Congrats again, Bro Wu. Cheers.

21:52.400 --> 21:53.000
Xing Wu.

21:54.080 --> 21:55.160
Congratulations on winning the game

21:55.440 --> 21:56.040
and also taking today's

21:56.040 --> 21:56.720
MVP.

21:58.880 --> 22:00.080
I know your leg was injured.

22:01.040 --> 22:01.600
In this game,

22:01.600 --> 22:03.120
if your leg hadn't been hurt,

22:04.000 --> 22:05.240
maybe MVP would've been yours.

22:06.120 --> 22:07.600
You didn't just win prize money today.

22:08.400 --> 22:10.040
I heard a provincial team coach

22:10.320 --> 22:11.160
wants you on the team.

22:11.520 --> 22:13.080
I'm not interested in the provincial team.

22:14.120 --> 22:15.120
I don't want to be an athlete.

22:15.520 --> 22:17.240
I just needed the prize money.

22:17.400 --> 22:18.400
What are you pretending for?

22:18.760 --> 22:19.520
Can you stand up

22:19.520 --> 22:20.440
when you talk to Ping?

22:20.840 --> 22:21.880
Did you know Ping

22:21.880 --> 22:22.720
risked everything

22:22.760 --> 22:23.520
for this game?

22:23.720 --> 22:24.600
Risked what?

22:24.760 --> 22:26.360
He just hurt one leg.

22:26.360 --> 22:27.440
He's still alive

22:27.440 --> 22:28.200
right here, isn't he?

22:28.640 --> 22:30.160
If you want to join the provincial team,

22:30.160 --> 22:31.120
go find the coach yourselves.

22:31.400 --> 22:32.880
Anyway, Wu has

22:32.880 --> 22:34.080
no interest in the provincial team.

22:34.280 --> 22:34.760
What do you mean?

22:34.760 --> 22:35.520
You want to fight, right?

22:35.680 --> 22:36.880
I don't want to fight.

22:36.920 --> 22:38.520
I'm just telling the truth. What?

22:38.880 --> 22:40.000
Can't I tell the truth?

22:40.080 --> 22:41.720
It's an injured leg, not a crippled one.

22:42.280 --> 22:43.280
Stop causing trouble, okay?

22:43.360 --> 22:43.880
No, you...

22:43.920 --> 22:45.080
Is hitting people all you know?

22:45.240 --> 22:46.200
Who are you pushing?

22:46.680 --> 22:47.600
Don't make me hit you.

22:48.120 --> 22:49.080
Everyone, say less.

22:49.840 --> 22:51.360
My buddy speaks harshly.

22:51.760 --> 22:52.440
Sorry about that.

22:53.960 --> 22:54.520
I'll drink to you.

22:55.360 --> 22:55.960
Wait.

22:58.840 --> 22:59.640
Use this.

23:02.520 --> 23:03.000
Exactly.

23:03.200 --> 23:04.160
Why so arrogant?

23:04.200 --> 23:04.720
You're using this

23:04.720 --> 23:05.520
to toast Ping?

23:05.520 --> 23:06.760
Are you taking my kindness for weakness?

23:07.000 --> 23:07.640
What do you mean?

23:07.640 --> 23:08.440
Who are you pushing?

23:08.440 --> 23:09.120
What do you mean?

23:09.120 --> 23:10.040
I don't mean anything.

23:10.040 --> 23:10.440
Touch me again.

23:10.440 --> 23:11.360
Try touching me again.

23:11.360 --> 23:12.040
If you dare hit me,

23:12.040 --> 23:12.720
I'll drop right here

23:12.760 --> 23:13.800
and make you pay for it.

23:13.920 --> 23:14.520
Hit me.

23:14.920 --> 23:15.920
Right, right, Cao Ping.

23:16.720 --> 23:17.400
The provincial team

23:17.680 --> 23:19.080
doesn't take cripples, does it?

23:19.440 --> 23:20.440
Say that again.

23:36.080 --> 23:36.720
Hit me.

23:37.520 --> 23:38.040
Kyle.

23:59.680 --> 24:00.360
Cao Ping.

24:00.960 --> 24:02.000
I have absolutely no interest

24:02.600 --> 24:03.400
in the provincial team.

24:19.760 --> 24:20.560
Xing Wu.

24:25.080 --> 24:25.760
Wu.

24:30.360 --> 24:31.000
Wu.

24:31.920 --> 24:33.160
Call 120 now.

24:33.760 --> 24:34.560
Boss.

24:35.160 --> 24:36.280
Call an ambulance.

25:03.440 --> 25:04.640
In a moment of rage,

25:06.080 --> 25:07.240
Cao Ping slashed my back.

25:08.200 --> 25:08.960
He got two years.

25:16.680 --> 25:17.360
If

25:18.280 --> 25:19.320
that hadn't happened,

25:21.280 --> 25:22.880
would you have applied to be a pilot?

25:28.960 --> 25:30.120
Maybe this is fate.

25:31.840 --> 25:32.840
I used to think

25:33.880 --> 25:35.040
I was so close to my dream.

25:38.880 --> 25:39.760
Take off your shirt.

25:50.360 --> 25:51.000
Turn around.

26:04.520 --> 26:05.320
Student Xing Wu,

26:08.800 --> 26:09.600
please step outside first.

26:20.720 --> 26:22.160
I once heard someone say

26:22.880 --> 26:24.800
that days crushed by pain

26:25.600 --> 26:26.560
are like

26:27.240 --> 26:29.240
mud left after the tide goes out.

26:29.600 --> 26:30.520
They may look miserable,

26:30.800 --> 26:31.400
but

26:31.760 --> 26:33.440
when the sun rises,

26:33.960 --> 26:35.720
shell fragments appear

26:36.040 --> 26:37.080
and reflect dazzling colors.

26:38.200 --> 26:39.160
Those colors

26:39.960 --> 26:41.680
will become marks of life

26:42.560 --> 26:43.680
that belong only to you.

26:49.960 --> 26:50.920
Each of us

26:50.920 --> 26:52.840
has a life path we want to pursue.

26:53.720 --> 26:54.680
Take me, for example.

26:55.520 --> 26:57.120
I thought that by now

26:57.240 --> 26:58.360
I'd be studying abroad.

26:58.600 --> 26:59.320
But look where I am.

27:03.080 --> 27:04.440
But I never blame

27:05.160 --> 27:06.680
fate for putting me here,

27:07.440 --> 27:08.680
for letting me live

27:09.360 --> 27:10.520
another kind of life in Zhazhating.

27:13.040 --> 27:14.320
On the contrary, I'm grateful.

27:16.120 --> 27:17.880
Because every second here

27:20.240 --> 27:22.120
makes my youth all the more dazzling.

27:50.960 --> 27:51.520
Well...

27:52.640 --> 27:53.240
It's late.

27:53.760 --> 27:54.600
Go back early.

28:03.040 --> 28:03.880
Good luck

28:05.560 --> 28:06.200
on tomorrow's test.

28:08.400 --> 28:09.080
Don't worry.

28:09.400 --> 28:10.280
I'm aiming to win.

28:15.200 --> 28:15.680
Here.

28:37.560 --> 28:38.000
Over there.

28:38.040 --> 28:38.520
Okay.

28:50.320 --> 28:51.080
These past few days,

28:51.080 --> 28:52.320
she seems to eat

28:53.320 --> 28:54.720
and study alone.

28:55.120 --> 28:56.080
Look at her act.

28:57.880 --> 28:59.240
What a fake good girl.

28:59.560 --> 29:00.960
If she still doesn't get picked,

29:01.880 --> 29:03.640
I'd be embarrassed for her.

29:05.640 --> 29:06.560
At least she's working hard.

29:06.800 --> 29:07.440
Good for her.

29:08.520 --> 29:09.920
Even working hard, she can't beat Qing Ye.

29:10.040 --> 29:10.640
Working hard?

29:10.640 --> 29:11.240
You eat first.

29:11.280 --> 29:11.960
I'll go over.

29:12.080 --> 29:12.840
We'll see.

29:13.640 --> 29:15.240
I can't stand people like her.

29:23.280 --> 29:24.080
Why are you glaring at us?

29:28.920 --> 29:29.520
What?

29:30.000 --> 29:30.720
Eat.

29:32.320 --> 29:33.680
If you don't eat now, it'll get cold.

29:35.040 --> 29:35.840
None of your business.

29:37.600 --> 29:39.760
You don't look well.

29:40.280 --> 29:41.040
Are you okay?

29:42.400 --> 29:43.320
Mind your own business.

29:54.880 --> 29:56.520
Okay. Begin answering now.

31:12.120 --> 31:12.800
Sir! Sir!

31:13.280 --> 31:14.120
Cao Fan fainted.

31:15.120 --> 31:15.560
Cao Fan.

31:15.640 --> 31:16.240
What's wrong?

31:16.520 --> 31:16.960
Cao Fan.

31:17.360 --> 31:17.840
Cao Fan.

31:17.880 --> 31:18.320
How are you?

31:37.760 --> 31:38.440
Hello? What happened?

31:38.960 --> 31:39.920
Brother Ping, bad news.

31:39.920 --> 31:40.360
Bad news.

31:40.520 --> 31:41.480
Didn't you ask me

31:41.480 --> 31:42.400
to have someone watch your sister?

31:42.520 --> 31:44.040
She's out cold at the county hospital.

31:44.320 --> 31:45.120
It doesn't look good.

31:45.520 --> 31:47.160
Xing Wu and his sister

31:47.160 --> 31:47.720
brought her in.

31:47.880 --> 31:48.520
My guess is

31:48.840 --> 31:50.000
it has something to do with them.

31:52.400 --> 31:52.960
Doctor.

31:54.040 --> 31:55.520
How is this child?

31:56.400 --> 31:57.440
38.9 degrees.

31:57.720 --> 31:58.560
That's a high fever.

31:58.920 --> 31:59.880
We also ran blood tests just now.

32:00.280 --> 32:01.000
Low blood sugar.

32:01.080 --> 32:02.840
She's a little malnourished too.

32:03.240 --> 32:04.120
And the nosebleed?

32:04.160 --> 32:05.280
Her nasal membrane is too dry.

32:05.560 --> 32:07.080
Looks like she's been staying up late

32:07.320 --> 32:08.120
and not resting well.

32:08.680 --> 32:09.200
Doctor,

32:09.320 --> 32:10.600
when will she wake up?

32:11.720 --> 32:12.400
From the look of it,

32:12.400 --> 32:13.240
she's still very weak.

32:13.600 --> 32:14.160
Of course,

32:14.640 --> 32:15.600
it's nothing too serious.

32:15.720 --> 32:17.200
Let her rest properly first.

32:17.640 --> 32:18.520
Call me if anything comes up.

32:18.760 --> 32:19.160
Okay.

32:19.520 --> 32:20.200
Thank you, doctor.

32:23.520 --> 32:24.200
Mr. Zhu.

32:24.640 --> 32:25.720
Why don't you go back to school first?

32:26.080 --> 32:27.160
We'll stay here with her.

32:28.560 --> 32:29.160
All right.

32:29.240 --> 32:30.880
I'll come after evening study

32:31.000 --> 32:31.840
to take over from you.

32:32.400 --> 32:32.800
Okay.

32:32.840 --> 32:33.640
Thank you, Xing Wu.

32:38.520 --> 32:39.200
Actually,

32:39.480 --> 32:40.680
before the exam, I already noticed

32:40.720 --> 32:41.880
something was wrong with her.

32:42.360 --> 32:44.000
I should've told the teacher sooner.

32:45.520 --> 32:46.520
Don't overthink it.

32:46.920 --> 32:47.920
The doctor just said

32:48.240 --> 32:49.080
it's nothing serious.

32:49.640 --> 32:50.280
Don't worry.

32:52.600 --> 32:53.640
I'll go buy you something to eat.

34:37.239 --> 34:37.960
You're awake.

34:39.440 --> 34:40.800
How do you feel? Better?

34:51.000 --> 34:52.040
I have a thermos here.

34:52.159 --> 34:53.360
Weren't you looking for one earlier?

34:53.400 --> 34:54.120
Use this for now.

34:54.719 --> 34:55.320
Thank you.

34:55.760 --> 34:56.520
The water room is over there.

34:57.360 --> 34:58.200
I can go myself.

34:58.280 --> 34:58.720
Okay.

35:02.640 --> 35:03.640
I know you blame me.

35:06.840 --> 35:08.280
I failed as your brother.

35:10.640 --> 35:11.960
No wonder you don't want to talk to me.

35:20.560 --> 35:21.680
If anyone at school bullies you,

35:21.680 --> 35:22.440
remember to tell me.

35:25.280 --> 35:25.920
Then what?

35:32.200 --> 35:33.280
Will you hit people again

35:33.280 --> 35:34.160
like before?

35:34.920 --> 35:36.000
Too many people bully me.

35:36.120 --> 35:37.080
Can you fight them all?

35:43.640 --> 35:44.320
Just go.

35:44.840 --> 35:45.720
I can't sleep if you don't leave.

35:50.800 --> 35:51.680
Take care of yourself.

36:29.120 --> 36:30.640
Xing Wu and his sister

36:30.680 --> 36:31.240
brought her in.

36:31.400 --> 36:32.000
My guess is

36:32.160 --> 36:33.360
it has something to do with them.

36:34.320 --> 36:35.360
Too many people bully me.

36:35.440 --> 36:36.400
Can you fight them all?

37:01.560 --> 37:02.400
Where do you think you're going?

37:05.600 --> 37:06.880
You're Cao Fan's brother,

37:06.880 --> 37:07.600
Cao Ping, right?

37:08.880 --> 37:09.920
I think you've misunderstood.

37:10.560 --> 37:11.880
Cao Fan and I aren't enemies.

37:12.080 --> 37:12.840
You don't need to explain.

37:14.120 --> 37:14.840
My sister

37:14.840 --> 37:16.120
ended up like this today

37:17.400 --> 37:18.800
because of you two siblings.

37:19.520 --> 37:20.720
You really misunderstood.

37:22.360 --> 37:23.120
This is a hospital.

37:23.800 --> 37:25.000
People will come any minute.

37:26.000 --> 37:27.360
I think you'd better calm down.

37:39.840 --> 37:40.760
You think I'm scared?

37:46.200 --> 37:46.920
Your sister fainting

37:46.920 --> 37:48.200
really wasn't caused by me.

37:50.160 --> 37:51.520
We were taking the exam.

37:51.760 --> 37:52.560
Then she suddenly

37:52.560 --> 37:53.520
started sweating a lot

37:54.400 --> 37:55.840
and fainted.

38:05.720 --> 38:07.160
Your fried rice, young man.

38:08.400 --> 38:09.080
Let go.

38:09.520 --> 38:10.600
Let go. Who are you calling?

38:20.120 --> 38:20.600
Don't be afraid.

38:20.960 --> 38:21.520
I'm here.

38:30.160 --> 38:30.880
Go back first.

38:31.720 --> 38:32.520
I'll talk to him.

38:33.760 --> 38:34.640
No, but...

38:35.640 --> 38:36.280
Don't worry.

38:37.640 --> 38:38.400
I know what I'm doing.

38:39.760 --> 38:40.400
Go back.

38:41.200 --> 38:41.720
Okay.

38:42.800 --> 38:43.640
I'll go back first.

38:44.840 --> 38:45.840
If you don't come back

38:45.840 --> 38:46.720
in ten minutes,

38:48.240 --> 38:49.120
I'll call the police.

38:51.960 --> 38:52.680
Go on.

39:14.200 --> 39:15.800
I told you not to touch my people.

39:17.880 --> 39:18.560
Pretty strong.

39:20.280 --> 39:21.240
What if I insist?

39:22.320 --> 39:23.200
What will you do?

39:24.320 --> 39:25.040
Simple.

39:26.520 --> 39:27.840
I want you, like me,

39:28.680 --> 39:29.480
abandoned by everyone.

39:30.440 --> 39:31.160
Then I'll be satisfied.

39:33.080 --> 39:34.120
Then come at me.

39:47.120 --> 39:47.840
In three days,

39:48.960 --> 39:50.080
we settle this once and for all.

39:53.360 --> 39:53.920
Fine.

40:13.280 --> 40:14.160
Sit here for now.

40:15.760 --> 40:16.320
Boss.

40:17.240 --> 40:18.240
Two more fried rice.

40:18.440 --> 40:19.280
No scallions, less spicy.

40:19.360 --> 40:19.800
Sure.

40:19.920 --> 40:20.880
And the one from earlier.

40:20.880 --> 40:21.600
I'll pay for that too.

40:21.600 --> 40:21.960
Okay.

40:22.040 --> 40:22.920
Add an egg to one.

40:23.000 --> 40:23.960
Sure, sure.

40:29.840 --> 40:30.520
Are you hurt?

40:31.520 --> 40:32.160
No.

40:42.400 --> 40:43.080
Did that scare you?

40:49.160 --> 40:50.960
It's my fault. I dragged you into this.

40:53.680 --> 40:54.920
Actually, I didn't lose out either.

40:58.240 --> 40:59.320
How did your talk go?

41:01.360 --> 41:02.840
Nothing happened. It went fine.

41:04.240 --> 41:05.240
Anyway, don't worry.

41:05.720 --> 41:06.560
I'll handle everything.

42:15.560 --> 42:16.520
Why did you come here to find me?

42:16.720 --> 42:17.920
I came to bring you food.

42:18.120 --> 42:19.240
What good food did you make me?

42:19.800 --> 42:22.240
Dumplings, braised pork,

42:22.520 --> 42:23.320
and other dishes.

42:23.400 --> 42:24.280
All your favorites.

42:24.680 --> 42:25.720
Then wait for me a bit.

42:28.760 --> 42:29.320
Wait.

42:29.640 --> 42:30.000
Brother.

42:30.000 --> 42:31.120
Why are you staring at me like that?

42:31.120 --> 42:31.760
Brother.

42:32.280 --> 42:32.760
I saw a watch recently.

42:33.000 --> 42:34.680
It looks really nice.

42:34.680 --> 42:35.360
A watch?

42:36.200 --> 42:36.840
Why do you need a watch?

42:37.360 --> 42:38.400
I just...

42:39.360 --> 42:40.120
All right, show me.

42:40.520 --> 42:41.240
Come on, open it.

42:41.440 --> 42:42.200
This one.

42:43.840 --> 42:44.360
It is pretty nice.

42:45.320 --> 42:46.240
Okay.

42:49.600 --> 42:50.040
After I finish the game,

42:50.240 --> 42:51.600
I'll buy it for you

42:51.600 --> 42:52.440
with the prize money.

43:15.200 --> 43:16.080
You're about to be discharged.

43:17.200 --> 43:17.680
Don't act like

43:17.680 --> 43:18.640
you know me so well.

43:19.520 --> 43:20.320
Consider yesterday my debt to you.

43:20.520 --> 43:21.560
I'll find a chance to repay it.

43:22.120 --> 43:23.320
How about you owe me one more,

43:23.640 --> 43:24.600
then pay me back big?

43:26.640 --> 43:27.440
What do you mean?

43:28.840 --> 43:29.960
You should go to the winter camp.

43:30.960 --> 43:32.200
You want to give me your spot?

43:34.520 --> 43:35.720
But I have one condition.

43:36.520 --> 43:37.720
Help your brother and Xing Wu reconcile.
